Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos8895: preserve transport evidence for TWRP

Use the second half of the retained RAM area as pmsg for the transport
diagnostic boot. Match the Samsung recovery layout so the recorder can
be read after a reset even when the Ubuntu root cannot be reached.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
@@ -49,7 +49,7 @@
 			compatible = "ramoops";
 			reg = <0 0x92000000 0x8000>;
 			record-size = <0x4000>;
-			console-size = <0x4000>;
+			pmsg-size = <0x4000>;
 		};
 
 		framebuffer@cc000000 {
